WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Q:No. Is that what you mean?

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.000
K:Right? We are examining the fact together, without authority, conclusion, motive, fear, or any accumulated answer from the past.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Q:Can thought end?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:18.000
K:Thought can end when the mind sees directly its whole movement and does not escape from what is actually taking place now.
